desc: Cab Driver Amp & Speaker Simulator (mda Combo port) by chmaha
tags: amp simulator speaker cabinet distortion guitar
author: chmaha
version: 1.1
changelog:
  Add full copyright and licence header (upstream authors' notices).
about:
  Amp and speaker simulator: drive the signal into soft or hard clipping, then through one of seven
  speaker and cabinet voicings (direct, speaker sim, radio, two small combos and two 4x12 cabinets).
  Drive left of centre soft-clips (warm), right of centre hard-clips (fuzz); Bias makes the clipping
  uneven for more even harmonics. The resonant high-pass sweeps out the low end before the clipper.
  Mono sums the input like the original plugin; Stereo clips each side on its own. As in mda's code,
  the cabinet comb and the resonant high-pass only act in Mono.
  Ported from mda Combo by Paul Kellett (Maxim Digital Audio), via mda-effects
  https://github.com/pluginguru/mda-effects (MIT or GPLv2+)
  JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
